              ],
              "value": "Dual regulator of transcription and autophagy. Positively regulates autophagy and is required for autophagosome formation and processing. May act as a scaffold protein that recruits MAP1LC3A, GABARAP and GABARAPL2 and brings them to the autophagosome membrane by interacting with VMP1 where, in cooperation with the BECN1-PI3-kinase class III complex, they trigger autophagosome development. Acts as a transcriptional activator of THRA"
            }
          ],
          "commentType": "FUNCTION"
        },
        {
          "commentType": "SUBCELLULAR LOCATION",
          "note": {
            "texts": [
              {
                "value": "Shuttles between the nucleus and the cytoplasm, depending on cellular stress conditions, and re-localizes to autophagosomes on autophagy activation"
              }
            ]
          },
